WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.734 align:start position:0% line:92%
Man, I feel like crap.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start position:0%
I just came from
a trashy Indian restaurant

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.204 align:start position:0%
in a strip mall.

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:06.572 align:start position:0%
Not bad food, though.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.041 align:start position:0%
Got pretty lucky.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.309 align:start position:0%
Got the hottest,
baddest curry

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:12.211 align:start position:0%
I ever ate in my life.

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.480
Place called Naan Sense,
Indian joint,

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:16.015
just, like, Terminal 3.

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:17.417 align:start position:0%
It's like, I'm going

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.819 align:start position:0%
to my brother's wedding
on Sunday, and it's like,

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.254 size:75% position:38%
I don't even want to go.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.388
I don't even like my brother.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:23.689 size:84% position:42%
My brother's, like, a jerk.

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.058 align:start position:0%
Don't like his wife.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.092 align:start position:0%
She's, like, a bitch.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.193
[rumbling]

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start position:0%
I stayed with them
for, like, three weeks.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start position:0%
She was a bitch
to me, man.

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:32.065 align:start position:0%
I put my feet
on her coffee table.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.900 size:78% position:39%
She was like, "Don't get
your feet on my coffee--"

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.834 size:75% position:38%
I'm like, "Who are you?"

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.169
[demonic growling]

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.236
[rumbling]
Scrimps.

00:00:37.269 --> 00:00:39.272 size:88% position:44%
A ginger broad, man, like...

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.373
[rumbling]
Scrimps.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:41.574 align:start position:0%
Those are the worst people
on the planet.

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:42.742 align:start position:0%
So I said that to him.

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:44.010 align:start position:0%
I said that to him
in the parking lot.

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.112 align:start position:0%
I cornered him
a little bit, sure.

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:48.381
(demonic voice)
Scrimps.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.382 align:start position:0%
He swung on me.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.783 align:start position:0%
Can you believe that?

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:52.885 align:start position:0%
It's like, who sings
on their own brother, man?

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:54.020 align:start position:0%
Yeah, I swung back...

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.956
[demonic growling]

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.424
But that's cool, you know.

00:00:58.457 --> 00:00:59.558
It's like, I haven't
seen him for a while,

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.528
but now I got this expensive
wedding I have to go to.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:03.729
So it's crazy.

00:01:03.762 --> 00:01:05.465
I got to get my tickets,

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.699
and that's a whole situation.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:07.967
I hate doing that.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.368
And--hold on a second.

00:01:09.401 --> 00:01:12.038 align:start size:59% position:41%
Hey, hey, pal pal.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.639 align:end position:100%
Start on
the downstairs bits.

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:15.575 align:end size:94% position:94%
I'm in the middle
of a conversation up here.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.877
[rumbling]

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.813
- Hey.
- Of course, of course.

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:21.614 align:start position:0%
Whatever you say.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:23.783
Thank you.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.084
Sorry about that.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:27.086 align:end position:100%
Just have
a little guy here

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:29.255 align:start size:69% position:31%
working on my suit...

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:32.625
(demonic voice)
From the eternal, from within.

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.393
You know, I mean, there's always
chicks at the wedding, right?

00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:37.163 size:75% position:38%
There is a guy in there.

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:38.564
- The answer is yes.
- [muttering nervously]

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:40.433
And hopefully, you know,
I can get, like,

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:41.667
two down in one evening,
you know?

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.136 align:start position:0%
[exhales]

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.670
And speaking of
"two down in one evening,"

00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:48.074
if they've got popcorn shrimp
and little lobster rolls,

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:49.408 align:start size:53% position:47%
I'm a happy man.

00:01:49.441 --> 00:01:52.078 align:end position:100%
But they're not
going to have that...

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:53.779
(demonic voice)
Stop!

00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:56.182
Who goes there?

00:01:59.718 --> 00:02:01.621 align:start position:0%
Sal.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.289 align:start position:0%
My name is Sal.

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:06.259
(demonic voice)
Sal...the end is near.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start position:0%
What?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.195 align:end size:41% position:41%
Why--what--
[stammering]

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:10.329 align:start position:0%
What do you mean?

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:12.465
(demonic voice)
Everything is changing.

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:13.533 align:start position:0%
What do you mean?

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.102
(demonic voice)
The end is near, Sal.

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:17.537 align:start position:0%
No, I don't know
what you mean.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.538 align:start position:0%
What do you mean?

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.805 align:start position:0%
I don't want to die!

00:02:19.838 --> 00:02:20.806
(demonic voice)
There's nothing you can do.

00:02:20.839 --> 00:02:22.341
The end is near.

00:02:22.374 --> 00:02:24.677
Everything is changing.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.480
From the eternal,
from within.

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:28.848 size:75% position:38%
No, I don't want to die!

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:30.449 align:start position:0%
What do you mean?

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:32.051
(demonic voice)
The end is near.

00:02:32.084 --> 00:02:34.453 align:start position:0%
(Sal)
What?

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:35.688
[squeaky fart]

00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:38.558 align:start size:72% position:28%
Sorry about that, man.

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:39.992 align:start position:0%
Of course.

00:02:40.025 --> 00:02:41.160
[bell chimes]

00:02:41.193 --> 00:02:43.496
Change is coming.

